 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Send `X-Larder-Site: annex` to select a site; omitted headers select `main`.
+Header names are case insensitive. An unknown site returns HTTP 400 with
+code `unknown_site`. Batches (including reads and waste), stock on hand,
+cooking, alerts, stock value and stock-takes use only the selected site.
+Order receipts must use locations in that site. Items, suppliers, recipes
+and dishes remain shared.
