 - Fridges must read at or below 5 °C and freezers at or below -15 °C. Each
   of them needs at least one reading per day.
 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- `sites` lists sites by string `id` and `name`. Each location has a
+  `site` referencing a site id; batches and stock-takes inherit it through
+  their location.
+- Schema 1 and 2 files migrate on load; all existing locations belong to
+  `main` ("Main kitchen"). The seed also includes `annex` ("Annex kitchen")
+  and its `annex-fridge` location.
+- Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared. Request stock operations
+  use only locations in the selected site.
